It is Thursday evening today.
It is half past five now.
I go to the sports club as usual.
I go to the reception desk.
I say to the man there, 'Brother, I want a racket on rent.'
He gives me a good racket.
Taking the racket, I come to the court.
Neha is waiting for me there.
We look at each other and smile.
Our badminton match starts.
Today's match is very competitive.
Neha hits the shuttlecock with great speed.
I run quickly and hit it back.
Between points, Neha smiles and teases me.
'Maya, are you very tired today?' she asks.
I laugh and hold the racket tightly.
'Now watch my next shot!' I tell her.
I hit a great smash and I get a point.
We have fun like this every Thursday.
